# the start-up intro (intro.c): at power-on the word GIO wipes in as the chime rises, the star lands with the chord,
# and a second later the song starts, as before, the chime ringing out under it. Any control skips it, the song starting when they are
# let go (or after 1.5 s: a stuck key); an "intro off" scenario or a second start (an update's return) has none
wav intro.wav
expect intro 1
expect playing 0
wait 150
shot wipe.png
expect intro 1
wait 330
shot landing.png
wait 300
shot splash.png
expect intro 1
expect playing 0
wait 600
expect intro 1
expect playing 0
wait 200
expect intro 0
expect playing 1
expect section 0
wait 1500
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -1
expect peak_db_min -30
shot after.png
# a restart: the intro again. A button held skips it; the song starts when it is let go, and the press (in the
# intro) does nothing more: PLAY's release does not stop the song
reboot
expect intro 1
wait 300
press PLAY
wait 600
expect intro 1
release PLAY
wait 50
expect intro 0
expect playing 1
wait 500
expect playing 1
# a key stuck down: the song starts after 1.5 s anyway
reboot
wait 100
key w0 down
wait 1400
expect intro 1
wait 200
expect intro 0
expect playing 1
key w0 up
# a turn skips it too
reboot
wait 200
turn K1 1
wait 50
expect intro 0
expect playing 1
# intro off: none, now or after a restart
intro off
reboot
expect intro 0
wait 100
expect playing 1
